  "operation": {
    "summary": "Get All Follow-Up Actions",
    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "Read operation. Retrieve all required pages before reporting complete totals. Returns the list of follow-up actions defined for a given record type (the reusable action labels available when logging a follow-up, e.g. *Follow-Up Call*, *Follow-Up Email*). The `type` path segment selects which record type's actions to list. Results are paginated. Requires the manage client-settings permission.",
