        "name": "type",
        "in": "path",
        "description": "The record type whose follow-up actions to list.\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| client | Client |\n| invoice | Invoice |\n| estimate | Estimate |\n| purchase_order | Purchase order |\n| staff | Staff |\n| supplier | Supplier |\n| product | Product |\n| work_order | Work order |",
